<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady/up $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady/up $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady</p>
<p>to $0.25 higher than Wednesday's close. Trade  moderately active.</p>
<p>Top $57.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     57.50-57.75</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     57.00-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     55.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     52.00-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: 300-500  lbs  steady to 0.50 higher; 500-700 lbs  steady</p>
<p>to  1.00 lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs	46.50</p>
<p>	   450-550 lbs	47.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	48.00</p>
</text>
